== R14: the headline against gRPC's marshaller, not against toByteArray ==
java.version=17.0.20  protobuf-java=protobuf-java-3.25.5.jar
grpc-java=1.74.0 (io.grpc.protobuf.lite.ProtoLiteUtils, the real object)
content set=ASCII  rounds=24  sink=399193500618336

Every arm writes into the same reused sink and every protobuf message is
serialised once. `pbj-grpc` is marshaller.stream() drained the way grpc's
framer drains it; `pbj-tba` is toByteArray, which is what this slice's other
tables are against and is kept so the two can be read together.


